      "text": [
        "5387 - وَ قَالَ أَبُو عَبْدِ اَللَّهِ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ : فِي عَبْدٍ شَجَّ رَجُلاً مُوضِحَةً ثُمَّ شَجَّ آخَرَ فَقَالَ \"هُوَ بَيْنَهُمَا\"."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.5387 - Abu Abdullah (as) said regarding a slave who struck one man with a muḍihah wound (a wound that exposes the bone) and then struck another man similarly:\n\"The compensation is to be divided between them.\""
        ]
      }
